COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."MailLog"."attachments" IS E'Array of file descriptors the send-mail function attaches. A URL descriptor is fetched over HTTPS, e.g. {"url": "https://invoice.stripe.com/.../pdf", "filename": "rechnung-A1B2-0001.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf"}, restricted to an allowlist of hosts. An inline descriptor carries a small generated text file itself, e.g. {"content": "BEGIN:VCALENDAR...", "filename": "kurs-12.ics", "contentType": "text/calendar"}, accepted only for text/calendar. Only admin-secret code writes MailLog. A failed or rejected attachment degrades to sending the mail without it.';
